  "display_fullname": "Dominator Control Water Control Tidal Wave",
  "display_help": "You blast foes in front of you with a violent torrent of water knocking them back, disorienting them and dealing Light Cold and Smashing damage to them. This power has a small chance to place the Drowning effect on its targets. Tidal Wave deals additional damage and has improved disorient duration and movement slow potency on foes suffering from Drowning.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Long",
